1. Helius Zolana SDK (@heliuslabs/zolana) - Apache-2.0
================================================================================

The Zolana "Privacy Rings" TypeScript SDK backs Shield, Shadow and Ghost.

  Upstream   https://github.com/helius-labs/zolana
  Version    0.3.0-alpha (tag v0.3.0-alpha, commit efed2ff)
  Copyright  Helius Labs
  License    Apache License, Version 2.0

It is vendored as `vendor/heliuslabs-zolana-0.3.0-alpha.tgz` rather than
installed from the registry, because the registry's published `0.2.0-alpha` is
broken against devnet. The Apache-2.0 text ships inside the tarball and is also
